晨光洒入，淡淡水汽，配简洁陶瓷茶杯与竹托盘；背景柔和、通透、无杂物。\n- Lighting_Style: 柔和自然窗光为主，前方轻微补光提升面板与水位窗细节，后侧细窄轮廓光勾勒机身曲线；高键调、低对比，暖色温，微弱高光点干净细腻。\n\n第二步：变量标准化 (Variable Definition)\n- {THE_PRODUCT}: A beige/champagne electric hot water dispenser (4.0L) with a satin-matte finish, monolithic rectangular body with softly rounded corners, integrated circular top lid and slanted control panel featuring warm orange accents, a small digital display and Japanese text, compact front spout, vertical blue-tinted water level window with white markings up to 4.0L, subtly beveled base, clean seams, side handle latch, rear power port; refined, minimal, reliable, premium household design with gentle, clean reflections.\n- {THE_SCENE}: A sunlit Japanese-inspired minimalist kitchen countertop of white quartz and light oak, airy and uncluttered; soft morning light, a hint of steam, simple white ceramic teacups and a bamboo tray, neutral backdrop with a subtle gradient or washi-like texture; calm, spacious, immaculate surface.\n- {THE_VIBE}: Warm, reassuring everyday luxury with Japanese minimalism; clean lines, serene neutrals; soft diffused natural window light plus delicate front fill and a slim back rim to sculpt edges; high-key, low contrast, subtle specular highlights; shallow depth of field; hero-centered three-quarter angle; premium product photography, crisp and retouched.\n\n第三步：KV 级大片提示词（纯英文）\nHero shot of {THE_PRODUCT} on {THE_SCENE}, captured at a three-quarter angle, hero-centered, shallow depth of field, 85mm product lens, f/2.8; soft diffused morning window light with gentle front fill and a slim back rim to define the silhouette; high-key, warm-neutral palette (beige, champagne, soft whites, pale blue glow in the water window), micro-detail on buttons and text, clean specular highlights on the satin-matte surfaces, a faint curl of steam suggesting ready hot water; minimalist composition with ample negative space, no clutter, pristine countertop, subtle background gradient with a Japanese-inspired 